     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">This is a cross post from stack overflow.<br><br>Dear shinyRs,<br><br><p>I am trying to add UI elements dynamically to a miniTabPanel but the \r\nelements are displayed not within the panel&#39;s space but on top of the \r\nTabstrip label row element and on top of each other, see example code below and the mess it \r\nproduces. It seems that one would need to set some initial height for \r\nthe panel or to put in some placeholder but I don&#39;t know how. I would \r\nhighly appreciate it if somebody could shed some light on how my \r\nthinking goes wrong here.</p><p><br></p><p>Thanks a million,</p><p></p><p>Bob<br></p><p><br></p>\r\n\r\n<p>miniUI_0.1.1 \r\nshiny_0.13.1</p><p><br></p><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">miniUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">TSTAddin</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> miniPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    uiOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;panelset&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> session</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  output$panelset </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    output$Test </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">actionButton</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Test&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;test&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> helpText</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;AAAAA&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    miniTabstripPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">miniTabPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Pan1&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">uiOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Test&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> helpText</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;BBBBB&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  viewer </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> paneViewer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">300</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  runGadget</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> server</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> viewer </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> viewer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">TSTAddin</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span></div></code></div><br><br></div>"
